sequenceDiagram

participant SDK
participant Backend
participant Database
participant Queue
participant ML

SDK->>Backend: POST /api/v1/observations (ASES Observation)

Backend->>Backend: Validate Observation

Backend->>Database: Store Observation

Backend->>Queue: Enqueue Analysis Job

Backend-->>SDK: 202 Accepted

Queue->>ML: Send ML Request

ML->>ML: Analyze Observation

ML-->>Backend: Prediction Response

Backend->>Database: Store Prediction

Note over Backend,Database: Results become available to the Dashboard